{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06469","headline":"题栖霞寺 · 綦毋潜","name":"题栖霞寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南山势回合，灵境依此住。\n殿转云崖阴，僧探石泉度。\n龙蛇争翕习，神鬼皆密护。\n万壑奔道场，羣峰向双树。\n天花飞不着，水月白成路。\n今日观身我，归心复何处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"綦毋潜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}